{
 "_about": [
  "Single data file for every robot-specific number the firmware uses. The joint limits and the leg and head rules",
  "come from the design, closed for the first build on 2026-11-18 (tools/import_design.py); the servo numbers come from public documentation. None has been confirmed on a real robot.",
  "After editing, run tools/gen_config.py to regenerate app/microduck/sketch/src/duck/robot_config_data.h.",
  "Angles are degrees from each joint's zero (the model's rest pose), signs as in the MJCF. Joint order is the MJCF actuator order, beak last."
 ],
