  "_note": "SCS0009: 1024 steps over 300 deg. steps_per_deg and the meaning of goal speed 0 are UNCONFIRMED on a real servo. reads_per_tick: servos read per 10 ms control tick while armed, round-robin; 8 reads all fifteen every 2 ticks, each joint at 50 Hz, the policy's rate. Each read costs bus time and delays replies to Linux by as much (UNCONFIRMED: measure the worst firmware tick in duck_status, bench checklist). Disarmed, one servo is read every 100 ms.",
